# The MOOD macro: on the PERFORM screen the ALGORITHM dial is the mood, 0 (chill) .. 100 (peak), 50 as the piece is. The engine is given
# each listed setting moved by its share (here the acid's density, 60 in the first piece, by 30 at the ends); the piece keeps its own.
seed 0
wait 3000
expect mood 50
expect moodacid 60
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 30
turn ALGO 5
wait 100
expect mood 60
expect moodacid 66
turn ALGO 20
wait 100
expect mood 100
expect moodacid 90
shot mood_peak.png
turn ALGO -50
wait 100
expect mood 0
expect moodacid 30
shot mood_chill.png
# off the perform screen the dial is the mode again, the mood stays
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
turn ALGO 1
wait 100
expect mood 0
# back to the middle: the piece as it is
tap HOME
turn ALGO 25
wait 100
expect mood 50
expect moodacid 60
